SDL-E1012 (spec/README.md#design-rules-settled)

  x `7days` is not a SurrealQL duration — an integer plus a unit, or a compound like `1h30m`
   ,----
 1 | database blog { changefeed { expiry: 7days; }; };
   :                                    ^^|^^
   :                                      `-- not a SurrealQL duration
   `----
  help: SurrealQL durations are an integer plus a unit (`7d`), or a compound (`1h30m`); units: ns, us, µs, ms, s, m, h, d, w, y — integers only, no sign or fraction
